      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JOSEPHINE OF TUFFY (5) went forward and gave a great sight before finishing second last time out over 2010m at Toowoomba. Knocking on the door of a maiden victory with three consecutive runner-up finishes. Suitably placed so anticipating another big run. SPRING RAIN (9) missed the placings two starts back then ran a better race and finished 2 lengths away in fourth last time out over 2010m at Toowoomba. Has her share of talent and will prove hard to beat in this suitable race. ACTS ALONE (1) is a nine-start maiden who could only manage to finish seventh at his latest appearance over 1800m at Gold Coast after he was well back on straightening. This is easier and expected to feature in the finish this time. FLIRTING WITH FIRE (4) finished 3 lengths from the winner in fifth at her most recent outing over 2010m at Toowoomba. Finds a suitable assignment this time and can improve sharply.",
